          "thisPhysicalEdgeDecision": "approve",
          "thisPhysicalEdgeNecessityRationale": "Both biodiesel cases require triglyceride structure and mixture identity, separation of direct oil use from methyl esters, motor suitability and origin-dependent environmental limits. Those are the oil competence itself; transesterification is the added dependent operation.",
