          "concreteJurisdictionReason": "The original BB/BE p.17 defines school-selected Wahlpflicht themes of the year-11 introductory phase, and p.23 places this content in such a theme. The broad Gymnasium/CrossStage jurisdiction key does not preserve school-form/stage/theme selection. This does not make the oil-to-biodiesel physical edge wrong, but no universal ordinary GK/LK source duty can be recorded.",
