          "thisPhysicalEdgeNecessityRationale": "The quantitative profile explicitly requires proportional charge-to-amount reasoning, different electron numbers, separation of amount and mass, and current-efficiency boundaries, including a separate qualitative case. These are exactly the two qualitative Faraday relationships, not merely a convenient calculation route.",
