          "sourceDecision": "hold_source_or_scope",
          "concreteJurisdictionReason": "Primary BB/BE p.53 places both quantitative Faraday laws in the additional LK column, despite the extraction saying unspecified and the docket targeting GK and LK. NI p.26 also marks both Faraday relationships eA-only. A broad jurisdiction-only key cannot universalise this. The NI selected row names only the first law; its known second-law alternative remains eA-only.",
