              "physicalDecision": "approve",
              "rationale": "The dependent interprets a condition-specific molar gas volume and compares different ideal gases and changed pressure. The Avogadro relation between equal V at equal T,p and equal particle amount is necessary to justify that common molar-volume model and its limits."
            }
          ],
