              "physicalDecision": "approve",
              "rationale": "Protein-product tasks require own sourced ecological, economic and ethical arguments, equivalent protein/function bases, a counter-source and explicit weighting. The prerequisite's independently generated and weighed pro/con arguments are the necessary reasoning operation, rather than optional background."
            }
          ],
          "sourceDecision": "hold_source_or_scope",
          "concreteJurisdictionReason": "The original selected operation is protein significance/function. That can be described without ecological/economic/ethical product arguments, counter-sources and weighting. The present researched-product judgment cannot acquire source status solely from that broader/narrower topical mapping.",
