      "scientificNecessityRationale": "Photometry requires judging blank, calibration range, nonlinearity, reference-control bias and the distinction between repeatability and accuracy. Claim-specific adequacy, confounds and bounded data conclusions are necessary to deciding whether a computed concentration may be released.",
