          "decision": "reject",
          "thisPhysicalEdgeDecision": "reject",
          "thisPhysicalEdgeNecessityRationale": "Washing tasks require micelles/dispersion, hardness precipitation and temperature/dose effects. The whole prerequisite also demands air/water interface orientation and explaining surface-tension reduction, which the current washing cases do not require. Micelles are a necessary subset, not the entire competence.",
          "routeNecessityReview": [
