          "thisPhysicalEdgeNecessityRationale": "Tensid-class tasks classify given heads/chains/counterions and discuss hydration, protonation and pH. They do not need deriving micelles, emulsion structures or surface-tension reduction; those aggregate effects are subsequent applications of amphiphile structure.",
