          "thisPhysicalEdgeNecessityRationale": "Alcohol oxidation class depends on the OH-bearing carbon and its available hydrogen. Explaining hydrogen bonds, dipole-dipole forces and boiling or water-solubility trends is not necessary to classify oxidation under the stated common mild conditions.",
