          "decision": "reject",
          "thisPhysicalEdgeDecision": "reject",
          "thisPhysicalEdgeNecessityRationale": "Recycling tasks require distinguishing retained chains from PET hydrolysis and using mass/energy flows. Full nucleophile-electrophile polymer synthesis with end-group-correct polyester/polyamide equations, finite linkage counts and HCl versus water elimination is not necessary to explain cleavage of a supplied ester linkage.",
          "routeNecessityReview": [
