              "physicalDecision": "reject",
              "rationale": "Recycling tasks require distinguishing retained chains from PET hydrolysis and using mass/energy flows. Full nucleophile-electrophile polymer synthesis with end-group-correct polyester/polyamide equations, finite linkage counts and HCl versus water elimination is not necessary to explain cleavage of a supplied ester linkage."
            }
          ],
          "sourceDecision": "not_accepted_due_to_physical_rejection",
