              "physicalDecision": "approve",
              "rationale": "Both purity-content cases require selecting a selective method, assessing blanks/repeats/drying, and rejecting nonselective mass loss or an interfering soluble component. Assessing adequacy, possible procedural errors and the limits of chemical data is directly necessary to the dependent's reliability judgment."
            },
            {
              "prerequisiteGoalId": "e313c1ee-a617-54ed-adea-c183da1e03d8",
