          "decision": "reject",
          "thisPhysicalEdgeDecision": "reject",
          "thisPhysicalEdgeNecessityRationale": "Dalton tasks provide water composition and an atom-redistribution model, then distinguish observation/law/hypothesis and isotope limits. Recognising constant CuO/FeS elemental ratios and excess reactants is a possible historical motivation, not a necessary prior competence for these tasks.",
          "routeNecessityReview": [
            {
              "prerequisiteGoalId": "e0d05c36-eaac-4c75-8ead-3fd5bdafefca",
