              "physicalDecision": "reject",
              "rationale": "Rutherford/isotope tasks can infer a concentrated charged nucleus and count p,n,e from given evidence and Z/A/charge. Explaining Dalton's historical assumptions and the law/hypothesis/model distinction is not necessary to perform those inferences."
            }
          ],
