      "scientificNecessityRationale": "Empirical formula and relative-mass inferences from elemental masses require treating a specified pure binary compound as having a fixed elemental mass ratio while separating compound composition from unused material. That is the constant-composition competence; gas-density information adds molecular-size discrimination.",
