      "canonicalEdgeFinding": "physical_necessity",
      "scientificNecessityRationale": "The secondary-cell tasks explain forced charging versus voluntary discharging, reconstruct reactions and assess energy for a real purpose under bounded conditions. Understanding reversible operation, distinct energy directions and why a device-empty or nonrechargeable battery is not automatically rechargeable is necessary to that stated secondary-cell function and use boundary.",
      "exactOperativeBindings": [
        {
          "role": "prerequisite",
          "goalId": "efa24b77-0f98-5835-9d82-3e539ab20253",
          "title": "Freiwillige und erzwungene Redoxreaktionen vergleichen",
          "description": "Die lernende Person kann an einer geeigneten reversibel arbeitenden elektrochemischen Zelle freiwillige und erzwungene Redoxvorgänge beim Entladen und Laden vergleichen und Alltagsformulierungen zu leeren Batterien oder geladenen Akkus fachlich beurteilen.",
          "goalCanonicalJSONSHA256": "fc109ff3e72d6d0f7db3aed13b8dfc7f7ea3715c04b8bf932b65718d052fc8a2",
