          "decision": "hold",
          "thisPhysicalEdgeDecision": "approve",
          "thisPhysicalEdgeNecessityRationale": "The secondary-cell tasks explain forced charging versus voluntary discharging, reconstruct reactions and assess energy for a real purpose under bounded conditions. Understanding reversible operation, distinct energy directions and why a device-empty or nonrechargeable battery is not automatically rechargeable is necessary to that stated secondary-cell function and use boundary.",
          "routeNecessityReview": [
            {
              "prerequisiteGoalId": "efa24b77-0f98-5835-9d82-3e539ab20253",
              "dependentGoalId": "16b24dc5-0e48-5e3b-8307-01289db8d1a9",
              "groupIndex": 75,
