          "thisPhysicalEdgeNecessityRationale": "Successful filtration, distillation and extraction choice must identify and compare the relevant phase, particle-size, volatility and solvent-specific solubility properties, and explain why one property alone does not establish identity or purity. Those are the generic property-description/classification operations, applied to separation.",
