      "scientificNecessityRationale": "Brønsted cases ask formal proton-transfer roles and equations and explicitly decline pH/equilibrium-amount inference. Relative H3O+/OH− population classification, neutral-temperature/activity boundaries and numerical ratio interpretation are not necessary to that formal task; only acid-particle versus solution distinction overlaps.",
