          "concreteJurisdictionReason": "Full selected route fails scientifically necessary prerequisite closure. Blocking physical edge group(s): 44, 83. The quantitative-food cases select and evaluate supplied calibration/titration data, with no required own execution. The prerequisite's experiment-and-calculation determination of a pure component and method-reliability performance is broader; meaningful selection/calculation alone does not require prior completion of its whole experimental competence.",
